<mxfile host="opslab"><diagram name="4. 진단 순서 — 무중단 장치가 제 역할을 하나"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="① 증상: 재시작 반복? 배포가 안 끝남? 점검이 안 끝남? 한꺼번에 중단?" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="1140" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="재시작 반복&lt;br&gt;kubectl describe pod&lt;br&gt;→ Liveness/Startup probe failed&lt;br&gt;→ probe 경로·시간 vs 앱 시작 시간" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="110" width="270" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="배포가 안 끝남·결함이 나감&lt;br&gt;kubectl argo rollouts get rollout&lt;br&gt;→ AnalysisRun 측정값·판정&lt;br&gt;→ 분석 템플릿 지표·기준" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="310" y="110" width="270" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="점검이 안 끝남&lt;br&gt;kubectl get pdb (ALLOWED)&lt;br&gt;→ drain 이벤트(evict 거부)&lt;br&gt;→ minAvailable vs 파드 수" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="110" width="270" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="한꺼번에 중단&lt;br&gt;파드의 노드·AZ 분포&lt;br&gt;→ PDB·spread·nodeSelector&lt;br&gt;→ FIS·노드 상태" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="890" y="110" width="270" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c1" target="c2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c1" target="c3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c1" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c1" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="② 바꾼 것 찾기: git log -p gitops/envs/prod/values.yaml · CloudTrail(UpdateNodegroupConfig)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="250" width="1140" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="③ 고치기: Git 커밋(revert)으로 — 클러스터를 손으로 고치면 자동 치유가 되돌린다 · 점검 끝난 노드는 uncordon" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="315" width="1140" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="④ 재발 방지: probe 역할 구분 · 판정 조건은 &#x27;데이터 없음 = 실패&#x27; · PDB 는 파드 수보다 작게 · AZ 분산 · 자동 복구 범위 제한" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="380" width="1140" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>